WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.750
This is how to use my canvas.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.730
Press one of these buttons to add a

3
00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.950
shape of a random size or color.

4
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:12.070
We got squares, rectangles, circles, and now we

5
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.210
can randomize them.

6
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.390
Move them around to a random location, but

7
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.430
they will keep their same size and color.

8
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.050
And press clear to clean the slate.
